ated with kids in mind to help them have a meaningful and joyful way to learn about amazing Black inventors, entertainers, activists, scientists, athletes and more!    \n\nEach Bite-Sized Black History episode contains engaging stories and information that is sure to foster meaningful conversations about Black history with kiddos that goes beyond the bounds of struggle to focus on creativity, ingenuity, joy, and brilliance!    \n\nWant some more Bite-Sized Black History? Head over to firstnamebasis.org/blackhistory for additional episodes!","author":"First Name Basis","imageUrl":"https://assets.pippa.io/shows/65baa4723355300016266744/1706756618236-a3c45598e34707b97e90733166044d44.jpeg","previewAudio":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0051/8845/2401/files/bite-sized-black-history.mp3","cover":{"imageL":"https://card-content.yotoplay.com/1AK7O3RyIVFUe9PkWPIZ8Mj5-PNf4Q3KwpVlcAfb5keJ7QfYFr5OIFk6r3ULQswWb/pub/VgUz2lb_ylo-B6deRZF_jSXZ2RUlAFgvRK1QaX5IhMc"},"media":{"duration":0,"fileSize":0}},"cardId":"ev0dQ","createdAt":"2024-02-07T08:29:09.521Z","updatedAt":"2025-01-09T12:24:14.582Z","lastCheckedAt":"2026-11-01T00:33:34.001Z","slug":"bite-sized-black-history","sortkey":"bite-sized-black-history"},"ownership":{"canAccess":true,"userHasRole":false,"cardIsFree":true,"cardIsMadeByUser":false,"cardIsInFamilyLibrary":false,"cardIsCreatedByFamily":false,"isAccessibleUsingSubscription":false,"isAccessibleAsPhysicalPlay":false,"isShareLink":false,"isReconditionCard":false,"inCardPacks":false,"previewAccessOnly":true}}